      "metadata": {
        "tags": "funk, Dusty 90s neo-soul with Fender Rhodes and warm male vocals in Chinese. Lazy boom-bap drums and a thick, rubbery bass sit deep in the pocket. Verses are intimate and close-mic’d; chorus blossoms with stacked harmonies and soft ad-libs, Rhodes chords swelling. Subtle vinyl crackle and brushed percussion for a sensual, late-night chill vibe., bassline, smooth, soulful, soul, r&b, sensual",
        "prompt": "[Verse 1]\n你的髮 還有一點濕\n門一關 整個房間慢了節奏\n外面吵 這裡像被誰靜音\n你在我胸口畫圈 慢慢失守\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n你說今天 心有點亂\n想找個地方 偷個晚安\n我指著沙發 說剛剛好\n你的笑 把時間都放軟\n\n[Chorus]\nBaby 就這樣 別說話\n讓午夜溫柔 把我們融化\n你的呼吸 貼著我的回答\n一點一滴 把白天都融化\nBaby 再靠近 一點點就好\n讓節奏慢慢 把彼此拆穿\n在這一刻 不需要偽裝\n只剩你和我 心跳在回響\n\n[Verse 2]\n你腳尖 踢開高跟鞋\n赤腳踩在 我舊毛毯邊緣\n你說喜歡 這種舊舊味道\n像我們 說不清的甘甜\n\n[Bridge]\n燈再暗一格 世界退到門外\n指尖繞著你 腦袋一片空白\n這距離 太剛好 不多一公分\n你眼神一晃 我就投降承認\n\n[Chorus]",
        "gpt_description_prompt": "90s Neo-soul, vintage R&B, layback groove, smooth Chinese vocals, Fender Rhodes piano, boom bap drums, heavy bassline, soulful, chill, sensual",
